# Files are stored as normal git files (no Git LFS).
# The repo's LFS storage is over budget, and the whole project is ~15 MB, so LFS isn't needed.
# Binary files: never diff, merge or change line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.fbx binary
*.dll binary
* !text !filter !merge !diff
